IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. Q05-DAILY-TXN-TOTAL.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-N               PIC 9(4) VALUE 0.
01 WS-IDX             PIC 9(4) VALUE 0.
01 WS-AMT             PIC S9(9) VALUE 0.
01 WS-TOTAL           PIC 9(12) VALUE 0.
01 WS-INVALID-FLAG    PIC X VALUE "N".
01 WS-DISP-TOT        PIC Z(11)9.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
ACCEPT WS-N
PERFORM VARYING WS-IDX FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-IDX > WS-N
    ACCEPT WS-AMT
    IF WS-AMT < 0
        MOVE "Y" TO WS-INVALID-FLAG
    ELSE
        IF WS-INVALID-FLAG = "N"
            ADD WS-AMT TO WS-TOTAL
        END-IF
    END-IF
END-PERFORM
IF WS-INVALID-FLAG = "Y"
    DISPLAY "INVALID TRANSACTION"
ELSE
    MOVE WS-TOTAL TO WS-DISP-TOT
    DISPLAY FUNCTION TRIM(WS-DISP-TOT)
END-IF
STOP RUN.
